[[0,2087741,0,90,1,89,"2017-08-26T10:40:53","kobold","",[],"","Rothschild Just Sold Massive Amounts of U.S. Assets","https://truththeory.com/2017/08/24/breaking-rothschild-just-sold-massive-amounts-u-s-assets-experts-believe-leave-whole-financial-system-stake/","Conspiracy"],[1,10294727,0,2,0,2,"2017-08-26T10:49:04","kobold","",[],"<p>jacob</p>"],[1,10294752,0,10,0,10,"2017-08-26T10:57:41","o0shad0o","",[],"<p>The stock market is at a top and people are talking about bubbles, I don't think it's such a bad decision to offload some. TFV doesn't go into how large the trust is, or what categories were invested in, which makes a big difference.</p>"],[2,10294762,10294752,18,0,18,"2017-08-26T10:59:22","dooob","",[],"<p>Imo we are constantly in a bubble, it is created to keep us in place. I believe the bankers can create a financial crisis if they want to, thats why we live in a bubble. I am probably wrong cause it is an uninformed opinion.</p>"],[3,10294847,10294762,8,0,8,"2017-08-26T11:27:55","boogieboogie","",[],"<p>I think you are right, but I don't know shit in reality. But lets think about it, all this stock market is make believe, all the top companies are controlled by a small amount of people that work together. If they all agree to something all they need to do is spread rumors or give a interview at the WSJ and BAM, a spike or crash. There is also a car bubble that is currently (or very soon) popping and people aren't quite aware of it yet. I have read lots of articles in the past 6 months on car magazines about the issues. It won't be as bad as the housing crisis, but it will be enough for people to make some serious money if they knew it was coming...</p>"],[2,10295477,10294752,3,0,3,"2017-08-26T13:31:36","Womb_Raider","",[],"<p>This is big though. If Rothschilds are pulling out of the US economy, they may intend to crash it.</p>"],[3,10295997,10295477,2,0,2,"2017-08-26T14:43:51","o0shad0o","",[],"<p>This is one fund managed by one Rothschild, and he didn't pull out completely.</p>"],[1,10294772,0,9,0,9,"2017-08-26T11:01:00","MyDrunkAccount","",[],"<p>And here I was thinking I was done drinking for the day.</p>"],[1,10294815,0,2,0,2,"2017-08-26T11:19:28","10294815","[A]",[],"<p>Don't see any reason why someone would invest in <a href=\"https://www.xe.com/currencycharts/?from=GBP&amp;to=USD&amp;view=5Y\">GBP</a>... </p>\n<p>or the <a href=\"https://www.xe.com/currencycharts/?from=EUR&amp;to=USD&amp;view=5Y\">euro</a>...</p>\n<p>I'm sure they won't rise as the value of the dollar sinks... </p>"],[2,10336423,10294815,0,0,0,"2017-08-30T16:37:11","c0olking","",[],"<p>if the dollar takes a serious hit, all other currencies will take a hit. Its simply math. They trade.</p>"],[1,10294889,0,7,0,7,"2017-08-26T11:37:45","10294889","[A]",[],"<p>&quot;Breaking: Rothschild Just Sold Massive Amounts of U.S. Assets Which Experts Believe Could Leave “The Whole Financial System At Stake”&quot; </p>\n<p>I doubt they sink the boat. Mire likely is they have more information, and are doing some massive insider trading ahead of the bubble burst. </p>"],[1,10294945,0,5,0,5,"2017-08-26T11:54:42","gazillions","",[],"<p>China has a great way of dealing with their corporate pricks. Once they've started accumulating too much power and influence they're charged with corruption and no one ever hears from them again. The Rothchild's just wouldn't be.</p>\n<p>If China would stop killing dissidents\r\n their people would probably become more innovative and spirited, &amp; benefit the entire nation</p>"],[1,10294949,0,26,0,26,"2017-08-26T11:55:27","BlueDrache","",[],"<p>So ... The bankster Jews are trying to set up a profit from tanking the USA because Trump won't play ball in the global arena.</p>\n<p>Colour me surprised.</p>\n<p>When can we get rid of these pigs?</p>"],[2,10295002,10294949,8,0,8,"2017-08-26T12:05:41","vonHugenbuben","",[],"<p>Or tanking it just because they hate Trump, not even to make a profit. It's not like those bastards ever run out of money.</p>"],[1,10294998,0,2,0,2,"2017-08-26T12:04:22","totes_magotes","",[],"<p>That noise you hear is the market bubble getting ready to pop. It's gonna be a shitty Christmas for a lot of people.</p>"],[1,10295032,0,1,0,1,"2017-08-26T12:13:27","theoldones","[e]",[],"<p>pounds and euros are unstable though. who the fuck would invest in the current EU when the top exec of company there might get murdered for walking a in no-go zone</p>"],[1,10295197,0,1,0,1,"2017-08-26T12:45:44","CrustyBeaver52","",[],"<p>We are overdue for an adjustment.</p>\n<p>With Trump unable to get his tax cuts through - and without additional QE from the Fed, while the government is also cutting back on spending - some kind of downturn is inevitable. \r</p>\n<p>This is not a bad thing - there is a need to liquidate excess malinvestment left over from the Obama era anyways - and it hasn't been done yet.</p>"],[1,10295361,0,0,0,0,"2017-08-26T13:15:00","MyNameIsMud","",[],"<p>We should help him out and expel the Rothschild banking cartel from the USA. </p>"],[1,10295459,0,0,0,0,"2017-08-26T13:29:12","KILLtheRATS","",[],"<p>YEEESSSSS. CRASH THE ECONOMY WHILE THE RACES ARE KILLING EACHOTHER. RACE WAR IS GONNA BE SO AWESOME.</p>"],[1,10295703,0,0,0,0,"2017-08-26T14:04:58","lucasmoukra","",[],"<p>Does this means US economy is going to collapse. </p>"],[1,10295813,0,1,0,1,"2017-08-26T14:19:53","burns29","",[],"<p>The sale if assets is most likely a rebalancing of the portfolio due to stellar performance in the US market since Trump was elected. </p>"],[1,10295880,0,0,0,0,"2017-08-26T14:28:18","Apathy","",[],"<p>Housing and student loan bubbles about to go pop? Probably once the federal reserve increases rates enough. </p>"],[1,10296252,0,0,0,0,"2017-08-26T15:15:29","Belisarius505","",[],"<p>So what do you think, buy Gold, Bitcoin, or ammunition?</p>"],[1,10297227,0,0,0,0,"2017-08-26T17:25:46","JesusRules","",[],"<p>No war = no Shekels</p>"],[1,10297910,0,0,0,0,"2017-08-26T18:47:48","seeker","",[]